    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.DeviceProvisioningServices_1.3.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.DeviceProvisioningServices_1.3.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.3.0 (2026-09-03)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated to support API version &lt;code&gt;2026-08-31&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added managed identity authentication support for linked IoT hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the ability to disable local authentication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The preview-only Device Registry Namespace API from &lt;code&gt;2025-02-01-preview&lt;/code&gt; is not included in the stable &lt;code&gt;2026-08-31&lt;/code&gt; API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.EventGrid_1.2.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.EventGrid_1.2.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.2.0-beta.1 (2026-09-09)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for Event Grid resources and models from API version &lt;code&gt;2025-11-15-preview&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Migrated generation to the TypeSpec-based provisioning generator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
